everyone has sort of figured that out.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.650
-SATO, YADANO, USHIRODA GROUP
-Unnngh!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.610
-Gnnngh!
-PLAYING OLD MAID

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:00.650
10 GAME LOSING STREAK

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.360
Next time for sure.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.450
-CHIARAI, SHINOBINO, SONODA GROUP
-Where should we go?

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.910
I want to eat green tea sweets here!

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.950
Hey, isn't this cute?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.620
-Yeah! It's so cute!
-So wholesome.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.120
