00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.780
U-Uh, no?

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:54.910
-Oh.
-Hm?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.410
Alright then, I nominate myself.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.540
-Here it is!
-CHEEKY

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:02.380
"Things Cheeky Students Say on Trips."
This was ranked first!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.250
Wow, so segmented.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.210
RYOANJI TEMPLE

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.170
I'm being led by them!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.340
They're even walking in front of me!

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.430
You can't let this slide, Ryoko!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.430
I'm a bus guide!

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.850
Yes, bus guides are really cool!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.060
The power of the 2,500 pages
of tourist information I memorized.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.110
I'll show them!

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.780
Attention please.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.820
This rock garden at Ryoanji

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:35.740
is a Karesansui dry garden
with 15 rocks placed in it.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:40.580
Wherever you sit on the veranda,
one of the rocks will appear concealed.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.540
There are many theories,

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:47.960
but adding 7, 5, and 3
to make the perfect number 15

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.130
and then removing one

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:53.340
is a message to look within oneself…

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.720
Hm?

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.430
Uh… um…

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.350
They're not listening!

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.520
SHE IS PRETTY, BUT…!!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.980
No, Ryoko.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.900
It's not time to panic just yet.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:11.070
I won't let you keep
ignoring me for much longer!

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:13.650
Never underestimate a bus guide!

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.070
Here we have Kinkakuji.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.450
It was made by Ashikaga Yoshimitsu,

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.200
the third shogun of
the Muromachi Shogunate.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:25.080
Ashikaga Yoshimitsu is famous
for appearing in a certain anime.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.630
Which anime would that be?

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.250
Yeah, here we go.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.340
One of the 108 best
bus guide tricks. The quiz!

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:34.090
Well? You can't help but answer, can you?

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:37.220
Uh. What is it? I don't know.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:42.600
It's a golden building
but it fades before my charm.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.100
What's up with him?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.020
