-Hm?

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:48.190
Could we ask for a photo?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.480
Oh.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.440
Go ahead!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:55.660
-Um, no, we want you to…
-…take a picture of us.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.120
-Ah.
-Never mind.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.990
Tends to think people want his picture.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.620
What's with these kids?

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.620
-Momotaro!
-No…

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.830
The answer is Ikkyu-san.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.800
-NISHI HONGWANJI
-I-I've got to pull myself together.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:16.220
Hongwanji is the main temple
of the Jodo Shinshu sect.

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:20.760
The temple was built
in the Kamakura period by Shinran Shonin.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:26.520
Inside, the national treasure building,
Hiunkaku, along with Kinkaku and Ginkaku

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.360
is one of Kyoto's three
famous "kaku" buildings.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.520
Huh.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:32.820
They're not interested!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:33.940
DAZED

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.700
Ugh, a tough crowd!

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.860
-Are you really from a prep school?
-Look, Komi!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.990
-They were selling these!
-SHINSENGUMI DRESS-UP SET

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.540
She already bought a wooden sword!

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:45.750
What a freak!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.710
Oh, that's right!

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.790
Here at Nishi Hongwanji, the drum tower

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.670
was once used as
the Shinsengumi police headquarters.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:57.170
From Shimabara Omon to Sumiya Mibudera,

00:09:57.260 --> 00:10:01.140
many soldiers wore that
same jacket as they patrolled the area.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.390
Well? Kids your age
love Shinsengumi, don't they?

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.430
C'mon, take an interest!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.270
So we meet again, Kondo.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.730
What is this act? Who does that?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.070
-PRIEST
-Yay!

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:17.990
FLASH

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.660
That girl is always eating something.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:23.240
-34, 35…
-SHIMOGAMO SHRINE

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.660
