sit the same distance apart.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.160
That's what it's famous for.

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.290
They really are the same distance apart!

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.250
That's so interesting!

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.340
Oh, yes. How could I forget?

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:28.020
If even one person takes an interest,

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:33.520
